<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CSS 타이포그래피 & 색상 레퍼런스</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;600&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

:root {
  --bg:       #f5f2ec;
  --paper:    #fdfbf7;
  --ink:      #1a1612;
  --ink2:     #5a5248;
  --rule:     rgba(26,22,18,0.1);
  --mono:     'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  --serif:    'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
  --sans:     'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
  --sp:       40px;
}

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

/* ── COVER ─────────────────────────────────── */
.cover {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--paper);
  padding: 100px var(--sp) 80px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.cover::before {
  content:'';
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    0deg,
    transparent,
    transparent 39px,
    rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 39px,
    rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 40px
  );
}
.cover-inner { position:relative; max-width:860px; margin:0 auto; }
.cover-kicker {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.3em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.cover h1 {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.05;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.cover-sub {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  max-width: 480px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.cover-chips {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 36px;
}
.chip {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  padding: 5px 14px;
  border-radius: 100px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
}

/* ── NAV ─────────────────────────────────── */
.toc {
  background: var(--paper);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  padding: 0 var(--sp);
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 90;
  overflow-x: auto;
}
.toc-inner {
  max-width: 860px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  gap: 0;
}
.toc a {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--ink2);
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 14px 16px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
  white-space: nowrap;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}
.toc a:hover { color: var(--ink); border-bottom-color: var(--ink); }

/* ── PAGE WRAPPER ───────────────────────── */
.page { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--sp); }

/* ── SECTION HEADER ─────────────────────── */
.section-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 20px;
  padding: 60px 0 32px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.section-num {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--ink2);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.section-head h2 {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.section-desc {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--ink2);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-left: auto;
  max-width: 280px;
  text-align: right;
}

/* ── EXAMPLE CARD ───────────────────────── */
.ex-card {
  background: var(--paper);
  border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.ex-top {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 0;
}
@media(max-width:620px){ .ex-top{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

.ex-stage {
  padding: 40px 32px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-height: 160px;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
  background: var(--bg);
}
@media(max-width:620px){ .ex-stage{ border-right:none; border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule); min-height:130px; } }

.ex-info { padding: 28px 28px; }
.ex-label {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink2);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.ex-name {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.ex-desc {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--ink2);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.ex-code {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: #a8d8a8;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  padding: 14px 16px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  overflow-x: auto;
  white-space: pre;
}

/* ── COLOR GRID ─────────────────────────── */
.color-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 60px;
}
.color-card {
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--rule);
}
.color-swatch {
  height: 100px;
  position: relative;
}
.color-swatch-label {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 10px;
  left: 12px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  color: #fff;
}
.color-info {
  background: var(--paper);
  padding: 14px 16px;
}
.color-hex {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 2px;
}
.color-name {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--ink2);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.color-desc { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink2); line-height: 1.6; }

/* ── FOOTER ─────────────────────────────── */
footer {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40px var(--sp);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  margin-top: 80px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- COVER -->
<header class="cover">
  <div class="cover-inner">
    <p class="cover-kicker">// css reference document</p>
    <h1>타이포그래피<br>&amp; 색상 레퍼런스</h1>
    <p class="cover-sub">font, text 속성부터 text-shadow, color, direction, transform까지 — 10가지 실전 예제와 16진수 색상 팔레트</p>
    <div class="cover-chips">
      <span class="chip">font-family</span>
      <span class="chip">font-size / weight</span>
      <span class="chip">text-shadow</span>
      <span class="chip">text-transform</span>
      <span class="chip">direction</span>
      <span class="chip">color #HEX</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav class="toc" aria-label="목차">
  <div class="toc-inner">
    <a href="#font">Font 속성</a>
    <a href="#text">Text 속성</a>
    <a href="#shadow">Text-shadow</a>
    <a href="#direction">Direction</a>
    <a href="#transform">Transform</a>
    <a href="#color">색상 팔레트</a>
  </div>
</nav>


<div class="page">

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 1 — FONT
════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="font">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-num">01</span>
    <h2>Font 속성</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">글꼴 패밀리, 크기, 굵기, 스타일을 제어하는 기본 속성들</p>
  </div>

  <!-- EX 01 -->
  <div class="ex-card">
    <div class="ex-top">
      <div class="ex-stage">
        <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:2.2rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.03em; color:#1a1612;">
          Serif<br>Typeface
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ex-info">
        <p class="ex-label">예제 01 — font-family</p>
        <p class="ex-name">폰트 패밀리 지정</p>
        <p class="ex-desc">font-family는 텍스트에 적용할 글꼴을 지정합니다. 쉼표로 여러 글꼴을 나열하면 앞에서부터 사용 가능한 글꼴을 순서대로 적용하며, 마지막에 generic family(serif, sans-serif 등)를 폴백으로 지정하는 것이 관례입니다.</p>
        <div class="ex-code">font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
font-size: 2.2rem;
font-weight: 700;</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- EX 02 -->
  <div class="ex-card">
    <div class="ex-top">
      <div class="ex-stage" style="flex-direction:column; gap:6px; align-items:flex-start; padding-left:40px;">
        <p style="font-size:28px; font-weight:700; color:#1a1612; line-height:1;">크기 28px 굵게</p>
        <p style="font-size:20px; font-weight:400; color:#1a1612; line-height:1;">크기 20px 보통</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:300; color:#5a5248; line-height:1;">크기 14px 얇게</p>
        <p style="font-size:11px; font-weight:300; color:#5a5248; line-height:1; font-style:italic;">크기 11px 이탤릭</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ex-info">
        <p class="ex-label">예제 02 — font-size &amp; font-weight</p>
        <p class="ex-name">크기와 굵기 조합</p>
        <p class="ex-desc">font-size는 텍스트 크기를 px, rem, em, % 등으로 지정합니다. font-weight는 100(극세)~900(극굵) 사이 값 또는 bold/normal 키워드를 사용합니다. 두 속성의 조합으로 시각적 계층 구조를 만듭니다.</p>
        <div class="ex-code">font-size: 28px;
font-weight: 700;   /* bold */

font-size: 14px;
font-weight: 300;   /* light */

font-size: 11px;
font-style: italic;</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 2 — TEXT
════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="text">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-num">02</span>
    <h2>Text 속성</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">정렬, 장식, 자간, 행간 등 텍스트 레이아웃 속성</p>
  </div>

  <!-- EX 03 -->
  <div class="ex-card">
    <div class="ex-top">
      <div class="ex-stage" style="flex-direction:column; gap:10px; width:100%;">
        <p style="font-size:13px; color:#1a1612; text-align:left; width:200px; border-left:2px solid #ccc; padding-left:10px;">text-align: left</p>
        <p style="font-size:13px; color:#1a1612; text-align:center; width:200px;">text-align: center</p>
        <p style="font-size:13px; color:#1a1612; text-align:right; width:200px; border-right:2px solid #1a1612; padding-right:10px;">text-align: right</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ex-info">
        <p class="ex-label">예제 03 — text-align</p>
        <p class="ex-name">텍스트 정렬</p>
        <p class="ex-desc">text-align은 블록 요소 내 인라인 콘텐츠의 수평 정렬을 결정합니다. left(기본), center, right, justify(양쪽 정렬) 값을 지원합니다. 다국어 지원을 위해 start / end 논리값도 활용할 수 있습니다.</p>
        <div class="ex-code">text-align: left;
text-align: center;
text-align: right;
text-align: justify;</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- EX 04 -->
  <div class="ex-card">
    <div class="ex-top">
      <div class="ex-stage" style="flex-direction:column; gap:12px;">
        <p style="font-size:15px; color:#1a1612; text-decoration:underline;">밑줄 텍스트 (underline)</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px; color:#1a1612; text-decoration:line-through;">취소선 텍스트 (line-through)</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px; color:#1a1612; letter-spacing:0.25em;">자 간 넓 은 텍 스 트</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px; color:#1a1612; line-height:2.5; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.04); padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px;">행간 넓은 텍스트<br>두 번째 줄</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ex-info">
        <p class="ex-label">예제 04 — decoration / spacing</p>
        <p class="ex-name">장식선 &amp; 간격</p>
        <p class="ex-desc">text-decoration으로 밑줄, 취소선, 윗줄을 추가합니다. letter-spacing은 글자 사이 간격(자간)을, line-height는 줄 간격(행간)을 조절합니다. em 단위 사용 시 폰트 크기에 비례해 적용됩니다.</p>
        <div class="ex-code">text-decoration: underline;
text-decoration: line-through;

letter-spacing: 0.25em;  /* 자간 */
line-height: 2.5;         /* 행간 */</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 3 — TEXT-SHADOW
════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="shadow">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-num">03</span>
    <h2>Text-Shadow</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">X offset · Y offset · blur · color 4개 값으로 다양한 그림자 효과</p>
  </div>

  <!-- EX 05 -->
  <div class="ex-card">
    <div class="ex-top">
      <div class="ex-stage" style="flex-direction:column; gap:18px; background:#1a1612;">
        <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff; text-shadow: 0 0 20px #e05de0, 0 0 40px #7c6aff;">네온 글로우</p>
        <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:700; color:#f5f2ec; text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #ff6a9a, 6px 6px 0 #7c6aff;">레이어드 그림자</p>
        <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:700; color:#1a1612; -webkit-text-stroke:1px rgba(255,255,255,0.3); text-shadow: 2px 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);">드롭 쉐도우</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ex-info">
        <p class="ex-label">예제 05 — text-shadow</p>
        <p class="ex-name">텍스트 그림자 3가지 스타일</p>
        <p class="ex-desc">text-shadow는 X축 이동, Y축 이동, 흐림 반경(blur), 색상 순서로 값을 지정합니다. 쉼표로 여러 그림자를 겹쳐 네온 글로우, 레이어드, 드롭 쉐도우 등 다양한 효과를 만들 수 있습니다.</p>
        <div class="ex-code">/* 네온 글로우 */
text-shadow:
  0 0 20px #e05de0,
  0 0 40px #7c6aff;

/* 레이어드 */
text-shadow:
  3px 3px 0 #ff6a9a,
  6px 6px 0 #7c6aff;

/* 드롭 쉐도우 */
text-shadow:
  2px 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 4 — DIRECTION
════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="direction">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-num">04</span>
    <h2>Direction</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">텍스트 쓰기 방향 — LTR(좌→우) / RTL(우→좌)</p>
  </div>

  <!-- EX 06 -->
  <div class="ex-card">
    <div class="ex-top">
      <div class="ex-stage" style="flex-direction:column; gap:24px; align-items:stretch; padding:32px;">
        <div style="border-left:3px solid #2a7a4a; padding-left:14px;">
          <p style="font-size:11px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; color:#5a5248; margin-bottom:4px;">direction: ltr (기본)</p>
          <p style="font-size:16px; direction:ltr; color:#1a1612;">안녕하세요 Hello World →</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-right:3px solid #c0392b; padding-right:14px; text-align:right;">
          <p style="font-size:11px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; color:#5a5248; margin-bottom:4px;">direction: rtl</p>
          <p style="font-size:16px; direction:rtl; unicode-bidi:bidi-override; color:#1a1612;">← مرحبا Hello</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1px solid rgba(26,22,18,0.1); border-radius:8px; padding:12px;">
          <p style="font-size:11px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; color:#5a5248; margin-bottom:6px;">writing-mode: vertical-rl</p>
          <p style="writing-mode:vertical-rl; font-size:15px; color:#1a1612; height:80px; display:inline-block; letter-spacing:0.1em;">세로쓰기 텍스트</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ex-info">
        <p class="ex-label">예제 06 — direction &amp; writing-mode</p>
        <p class="ex-name">텍스트 방향 제어</p>
        <p class="ex-desc">direction 속성은 텍스트 흐름 방향을 지정합니다. ltr(Left-to-Right)은 한국어·영어 등 대부분 언어의 기본값이며, rtl(Right-to-Left)은 아랍어·히브리어 등에 사용됩니다. writing-mode로 세로쓰기도 구현할 수 있습니다.</p>
        <div class="ex-code">/* 좌→우 (기본) */
direction: ltr;

/* 우→좌 (아랍어 등) */
direction: rtl;
unicode-bidi: bidi-override;

/* 세로쓰기 */
writing-mode: vertical-rl;
letter-spacing: 0.1em;</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 5 — TEXT-TRANSFORM
════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="transform">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-num">05</span>
    <h2>Text-Transform</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">대소문자 변환 — uppercase / lowercase / capitalize</p>
  </div>

  <!-- EX 07 -->
  <div class="ex-card">
    <div class="ex-top">
      <div class="ex-stage" style="flex-direction:column; gap:16px; align-items:flex-start; padding:32px 40px;">
        <div>
          <p style="font-size:10px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; color:#5a5248; margin-bottom:2px;">uppercase</p>
          <p style="font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.15em; color:#1a1612;">hello world css</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size:10px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; color:#5a5248; margin-bottom:2px;">lowercase</p>
          <p style="font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:700; text-transform:lowercase; color:#1a1612;">HELLO WORLD CSS</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size:10px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; color:#5a5248; margin-bottom:2px;">capitalize</p>
          <p style="font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:700; text-transform:capitalize; color:#1a1612;">hello world css</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size:10px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; color:#5a5248; margin-bottom:2px;">none (원본)</p>
          <p style="font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:400; text-transform:none; color:#5a5248;">hElLo WoRLd CsS</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ex-info">
        <p class="ex-label">예제 07 — text-transform</p>
        <p class="ex-name">대소문자 자동 변환</p>
        <p class="ex-desc">text-transform은 HTML 원본 텍스트를 수정하지 않고 시각적으로 대소문자를 변환합니다. uppercase는 모두 대문자, lowercase는 모두 소문자, capitalize는 각 단어의 첫 글자만 대문자로 만듭니다. 로고, 내비게이션, 레이블 등에 자주 활용됩니다.</p>
        <div class="ex-code">/* 모두 대문자 */
text-transform: uppercase;

/* 모두 소문자 */
text-transform: lowercase;

/* 단어 첫 글자 대문자 */
text-transform: capitalize;

/* 변환 없음 (기본) */
text-transform: none;</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

